{"id":"ciertamente","lemma":"ciertamente","pos":"adv","rank":1569,"glosses":["certainly"],"ipa":"/ˌθjeɾtaˈmente/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2c/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Wikipedian-walker-ciertamente.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ciertamente, parece que ese es el caso.","en":"That does certainly seem to be the case.","words":[null,{"g":"to seem, to see fit","l":"parecer"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"case"}]},{"text":"Sí, ciertamente.","en":"Yes, of course.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/502602","words":[{"g":"yes"},null]},{"text":"Ciertamente deseo que suceda eso.","en":"I certainly hope that'll happen.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/299245","words":[null,{"g":"desire, wish"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to happen","l":"suceder"},{"g":"that","l":"ése"}]},{"text":"Ciertamente, estaré triste si muere.","en":"I'll certainly be sad if he dies.","words":[null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"As a temporary state."},{"g":"if, whether"},{"g":"to die","l":"morir"}]},{"text":"Ciertamente que es posible si se quiere.","en":"It is certainly possible if you want it.","words":[null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"possible"},{"g":"if, whether"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"}]}]}